{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"erfei-e-o030","title":"刘备立刘永为鲁王","accounts":[{"id":"erfei-a-a12a04a2d919babb8739","label":"正文","text":"刘备立刘永为鲁王","evidence":["erfei-q-d571d29f591fc5654bf4","erfei-q2-4229ce73dacb4619a49b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"章武元年六月使司徒许靖策立刘永为鲁王","evidence":["erfei-q-d571d29f591fc5654bf4"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0059","role":"奉命策立刘永为鲁王","evidence":["erfei-q-d571d29f591fc5654bf4"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0113","role":"被立为鲁王","evidence":["erfei-q-d571d29f591fc5654bf4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["erfei-q-d571d29f591fc5654bf4"]},"ordering_evidence":"erfei-q-d571d29f591fc5654bf4","source_order":[34,62,19],"order":6730}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0059","name":"许靖","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0113","name":"刘永","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"erfei-q-d571d29f591fc5654bf4","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-73d59e5e28371f20461f","layer":"original","quote":"章武元年六月，使司徒靖立永为鲁王","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":35},{"id":"erfei-q2-4229ce73dacb4619a49b","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-73d59e5e28371f20461f","layer":"original","quote":"刘永字公寿。先主子，后主庶弟也〖1〗。章武元年六月，使司徒靖立永为鲁王〖2〗。策曰：“小子永〖3〗：受兹青土〖4〗。朕承天序〖5〗，继统大业。遵修稽古〖6〗，建尔国家：封于东土，奄有龟蒙〖7〗，世为藩辅。呜呼，恭朕之诏！惟彼鲁邦，一变适道〖8〗，风化存焉；人之好德，世滋懿美〖9〗。王其秉心率礼，绥尔士民〖10〗，是飨是宜〖11〗。其戒之哉！”","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
